  // than merging into it) wipes mm_cid silently. The write returns 200, the
  // 700ms read-back after it passes, and the overwrite happens later - after
  // which sessionStorage says "sent" and caWrite(false) short-circuits on every
  // remaining page of the visit. The id is gone and nothing ever looks again.
  // Seen on a live store whose checkout app stamps its own attributes: only a
