  // lose the race. That is precisely why the Shopify order id remains the
  // primary join and this is only a second copy.
  var CA_SEL='[name="add"],form[action*="/cart/add"] [type="submit"],.product-form__submit,'
    +'.quick-add__submit,[data-add-to-cart],.add-to-cart,.btn--add-to-cart,[data-action="add-to-cart"],'
    +'.shopify-payment-button,.shopify-payment-button__button,[data-testid="Checkout-button"],'
    +'[name="checkout"],a[href*="/checkout"],form[action*="/cart"] [type="submit"],'
    // Third-party checkout buttons. These are the ones that matter MOST on a
    // product page: a "Buy Now" from an India-stack checkout app skips the cart
    // page entirely and hands off to the app's own flow, so the click is the
    // last moment we control. Without them the only stamp on that journey is
    // the page-load write, made before the shopper picked a variant and before
    // any later click id landed.
    // Shiprocket / Fastrr (name="sr-headless-button"), GoKwik, Shopflo,
    // Razorpay Magic, Simpl, Snapmint. Matched on their OWN class and name
