  //   2. The cart PAGE (last path segment 'cart', so /cart, /en/cart, /a/cart
  //      all count) - injected after the main cart form, scoped to <main>
  //      because Dawn keeps a second form[action="/cart"] inside its closed
  //      drawer earlier in the DOM.
