    //
    // This used to post immediately, unconditionally. Two things went wrong.
    // It raced every consent tool that loads after us, so the row it sent
    // carried four nulls; and on a site with no consent tooling it sent that
    // same empty row on every page view - 11,577 of them in a month on one
    // store, against 868 that meant anything. A record of "we looked and found
    // nothing", repeated per page, is not evidence.
